# comctl32: Implement Tile View style for ListView
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/10191 state=opened
# The Tile View in common controls offers a compact and pretty nice way to show some additional context within the list view, without resorting to the full reports mode.

It's used a lot in explorer like programs where things like the disk size and file type are shown.

But, it's been sitting unimplemented in wine for a long time.

Pictures:
========

Windows ListView with Tile mode active. The first entry uses a Callback
for the text and the columns layout, while the second is static.

